<ul>
<li><code>SensorData</code>: A single sensor reading, including the value recorded and the timestamp when the reading occurred</li>
<li><code>SensorDataBatch</code>: A batch of data points, to support batch streaming in your API</li>
<li><code>SensorCreate</code>: The fields for creating a new sensor</li>
<li><code>SensorDailyStatsResponse</code>: The daily sensor statistics</li>
</ul>
